igure> <p><img alt=3D"Image title" src=3D"https://help.ctrader.com/ctrader-=
algo/img/articles/developers/custom-indicator-lifecycle/06.png" width=3D"90=
0"></p> </figure> <h2 id=3D"the-ondestroy-method">The OnDestroy() method</h=
2> <p>The <code class=3D"highlight"><span class=3D"n">OnDestroy</span><span=
 class=3D"p">()</span></code> method is called when the indicator is remove=
d from a chart and is no longer needed. You will need to implement this met=
