ht"><span class=3D"n">OnDestroy</span><span class=3D"p">()</span></code> me=
thods illustrate different stages of the custom indicator lifecycle. By adj=
usting the sample code in the <strong>Algo</strong> app, you are free to de=
cide how to initialise indicator variables, calculate the indicator output,=
 and run finalisation tasks. </p> <figure> <p><a href=3D"https://ctrader.co=
